# D3-LI-006: Brightness and persistence can trade off
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 30mL @ 15C
add v1 luminol_glow_solution 3g
add v2 water 30mL @ 40C
add v2 luminol_glow_solution 3g
add v1 H2O2 0.0001mol
add v2 H2O2 0.0001mol
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
wait 2min
look v1
look v2
wait 8min
look v1
look v2
inspect
